@startuml
actor "用户" as User
participant "内容中心页面" as UI
participant "前端 catalog 适配器" as Adapter
participant "内容路由" as Route
participant "ContentCatalog" as Catalog
collections "presetManifest" as Presets
User -> UI : 打开内容中心，切换“预设”
UI -> Adapter : list("预设", ageMode)
Adapter -> Route : GET /api/v1/content?category=预设&age_mode=...
Route -> Catalog : list("预设", userId, ageMode)
Catalog -> Presets : 读取预设条目和 memberIds
Catalog -> Catalog : 儿童模式过滤受限成员
Catalog -> Catalog : 检查成员素材可用性
Catalog --> Route : 预设卡片列表
Route --> Adapter : {data: [...]} 
Adapter --> UI : 显示标题、简介和启用状态
UI --> User : 浏览并选择预设入口
note over UI,Catalog
  PR01/PR02 是目录预设；当前模块1不保存场景快照。
  后续场景创建与编辑由成员3负责。
end note
@enduml
